      110  == Economy {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      111  [[File:Дорога в Оргеевском районе.jpg|thumb|alt=Rural, four-lane road|A road in the district]]
      112  There are 40,693 registered businesses in the district. Fifty-seven are public companies, 4,606 are privately owned, 40 have mixed public-and-private ownership and 14 are foreign-owned. Manufacturing and agriculture are the dominant sectors of the district economy. There are 30 industrial companies:
      113  == Education {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      114  The Orhei district has 69 educational institutions, and the total number of students is 15,160. There are 1,448 students in teachers' and medical colleges, and 685 students in [[professional schools]].
