      192  == Culture {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      193  [[File:Orheiul vechi3.jpg|thumb|alt=Old religious painting on a wall|[[Fresco]] in Bosie cave monastery]]
      194  The district has five museums, 60 public libraries and 62 community centres.
      195  == Health {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      196  Orhei District has a 430-bed hospital, a family-health center, 33 family practitioners' offices, 14 [[Health Center|health centres]], and 17 health offices. There are 246 physicians and 836 other healthcare professionals.
